--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Address format metadata — Google libaddressinput
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Address format records and sub-region keys are derived from Google's libaddressinput address
metadata (https://github.com/google/libaddressinput, served at
https://chromium-i18n.appspot.com/ssl-address/data).

  "Source code licensed under the Apache 2.0. Data licensed under the CC-BY 4.0"
  — google/libaddressinput README

The data is used under the Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International License
(https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/). Changes made by EverShop: converted from JSON to
TypeScript, keys normalized to EverShop's AddressFormat shape, manual corrections from
scripts/address-formats/fixes/ applied (including Vietnam's 2025 provincial reorganisation),
EverShop extensions (address_lines, name_order, telephone.dialCode) added. The raw upstream snapshot
and the fetch date are recorded in scripts/address-formats/snapshot/manifest.json in the source
repository.

--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Person-name order and likely languages — Unicode CLDR
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
The name_order value of each address format record is derived from Unicode CLDR person-name data
(personNames.json) and CLDR likely-subtags data (supplemental/likelySubtags.json), distributed as
the npm packages cldr-person-names-full and cldr-core (https://cldr.unicode.org).

Copyright © Unicode, Inc. Used under the Unicode License v3 (https://www.unicode.org/license.txt).

--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Country calling codes — Google libphonenumber
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
The telephone.dialCode value of each address format record is the country calling code from
Google's libphonenumber metadata (https://github.com/google/libphonenumber,
resources/PhoneNumberMetadata.xml). Only the calling codes are taken; no number patterns are
bundled. Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0
(https://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0).
